OL,3,GNEWSAThree dead after family get into
OL,4,Adifficulty in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree members of the same family have
OL,7,Fdied after getting into difficulty in
OL,8,Fthe water off Shoreham-by-Sea.
OL,10,FSussex Police said three people - a
OL,11,Fman, a woman, and a teenage girl - had
OL,12,Fdied, while a younger girl from the
OL,13,Fsame family was in hospital in a
OL,14,Fcritical condition.
OL,16,FEmergency services were called around
OL,17,F14:40 BST on Tuesday to reports of four
OL,18,Fpeople in difficulty in the sea close
OL,19,Fto Shoreham Port, the police said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
